by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using the pysqlcipher with the following connection string:\r\n'sqlite+pysqlcipher://:{passwd}@/{filename}?cipher=aes-256-cfb&kdf_iter=64000'\r\n, it fails with:\r\n\r\nengine = create_engine(\r\n  File \"<string>\", line 2, in create_engine\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.9/site-packages/sqlalchemy/util/deprecations.py\", line 298, in warned\r\n    return fn(*args, **kwargs)\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.9/site-packages/sqlalchemy/engine/create.py\", line 653, in create_engine\r\n    do_on_connect = dialect.on_connect_url(url)\r\n  File \"/usr/lib/python3.9/site-packages/sqlalchemy/dialects/sqlite/pysqlcipher.py\", line 134, in on_connect_url\r\n    passphrase = url.password or \"\"\r\nAttributeError: 'str' object has no attribute 'password'\r\n\r\nThe reason is that on_connect_url \"expects\" url to be an URL object while it receives 'str' instead.\r\nA fix will be submitted and linked to this issue shortly.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reac